source: tui/src/chatwidget/tests/popups_and_settings.rs
expression: popup
---
  Agent Role Templates
  Create and inspect role profiles used by spawn_agent.agent_type.
  User templates live in $CODEX_HOME/agents/*.toml.
  Runtime tool catalog: 3 current-thread tools, 1 selected by current policy.

  1. Create new template                            Edit a native TOML role draft for future sub-agent
                                                    spawns
  2. Create template from current model             Seed a native TOML role draft with current model
                                                    defaults
  3. Create template from model catalog             Choose model/provider/reasoning defaults from
                                                    native catalog
› 4. Create template from current tools             Opens a searchable tool picker and then an
                                                    editable native TOML draft. The current-thread
                                                    catalog is used only as tool-id evidence; the
                                                    saved source remains $CODEX_HOME/agents/*.toml.
  5. [user active] explorer                         Custom explorer role for codebase discovery.
  6. [edit] Edit native TOML for explorer           Open this user role file in the inline TOML editor
  7. [model] Use current model defaults             Copy current model/provider/reasoning defaults
                                                    into explorer
  8. [model] Choose model defaults for explorer     Pick model/provider/reasoning from native catalog

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
